  m_Name: Dorothy Gale
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PebblePouch.Lore::PebblePouch.Lore.Entry
  _id: fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920
  _createdTicks: 639304141570769900
  _modifiedTicks: 639304141632276278
  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F467\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: A little girl from Kansas
  _description: 'Lives on the gray Kansas prairie with [[da3f88b3-2cfe-4218-a168-bd00d2d3ca58|Aunt
    Em]], [[e464a289-8457-452a-92b6-264c22c68d39|Uncle Henry]] and her dog [[d14761ac-e898-4090-aa24-430e2e2d8379|Toto]].
    A cyclone carries her house into the land of the Munchkins, where it falls on
    the [[f1b14b32-9a15-43bf-a44d-25040e68113a|Wicked Witch of the East]]. To find
    her way home she follows the [[4c7e8bfe-2089-411e-87e2-11fb62bda33d|Yellow Brick
    Road]] to the [[7d7db0c4-2516-4f3e-9975-1c9765bdffb8|Emerald City]].


    *The
    player character.*'
